<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Setelan - CekUangku</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4361ee;
            --primary-dark: #3730a3;
            --accent: #06b6d4;
            --bg: #f0f2f5;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-primary: #1e293b;
            --text-secondary: #64748b;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --sidebar-w: 260px;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-primary); display: flex; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }

        .main-area { margin-left: var(--sidebar-w); flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .top-header { background: var(--card-bg); padding: 20px 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; }
        .page-title h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); }
        
        .content-area { padding: 32px; flex: 1; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }

        /* ALERT */
        .alert { padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .alert-success { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; border: 1px solid #34d399; }
        .alert-error { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; border: 1px solid #f87171; }

        /* SETTINGS CARD */
        .settings-card { background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .card-header { margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 16px; }
        .card-header h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
        .card-header i { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--primary); }

        /* FORM */
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .form-label { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .form-input { width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .form-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.1); }
        
        /* AVATAR UPLOAD */
        .avatar-upload { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .avatar-preview { width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 3px solid white; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent)); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
        .upload-btn-wrapper { position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; }
        .btn-upload { border: 1px solid var(--border); background: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .btn-upload:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); background: #f8fafc; }
        .upload-btn-wrapper input[type=file] { font-size: 100px; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; opacity: 0; cursor: pointer; }

        .btn-save { padding: 14px 28px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent)); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.3); transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .btn-save:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.4); }

        /* COLLAPSE T&C */
        .collapse-container { background: white; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .collapse-header { padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; background: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); transition: background 0.2s; }
        .collapse-header:hover { background: #f1f5f9; }
        .collapse-content { padding: 0 24px; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out, padding 0.3s ease; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .collapse-container.active .collapse-content { padding: 24px; max-height: 1000px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .collapse-container.active .collapse-header i { transform: rotate(180deg); }
        .collapse-header i { transition: transform 0.3s ease; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* FOOTER */
        .custom-footer { background: white; padding: 24px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: auto; }
        .custom-footer a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
        .custom-footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        /* ---- SIDEBAR CSS STYLES ---- */
        .sidebar { width: var(--sidebar-w); background: var(--card-bg); height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); position: fixed; left: 0; top: 0; z-index: 100; transition: transform .3s ease; }
        .sidebar-brand { padding: 24px 24px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .sidebar-brand .brand-icon { width: 52px; height: 52px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent)); border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.3); overflow: hidden; }
        .sidebar-brand .brand-name { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
        .sidebar-nav { flex: 1; padding: 16px 12px; overflow-y: auto; }
        .nav-label { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.2px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 12px 16px 8px; }
        .nav-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 16px; border-radius: 10px; color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; transition: all .2s ease; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .nav-link:hover { background: #f1f5f9; color: var(--primary); }
        .nav-link.active { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.1), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05)); color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; }
        .nav-link.active i { color: var(--primary); }
        .nav-link i { width: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 1rem; }
        .sidebar-footer { padding: 16px 16px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .user-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; }
        .user-avatar { width: 42px; height: 42px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent)); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
        .user-avatar img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
        .user-info { flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }
        .user-info .name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-primary); white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; overflow: hidden; }
        .user-info .status { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #10b981; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
        .user-info .status::before { content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #10b981; border-radius: 50%; }
        .btn-logout { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; transition: color .2s; }
        .btn-logout:hover { color: #ef4444; }

        @media(max-width: 900px) {
            .sidebar { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            .sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
            .main-area { margin-left: 0; }
            .menu-toggle { display: block !important; }
        }
        .menu-toggle { display: none; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- SIDEBAR PARTIAL -->
    <%- include('partials/sidebar', { activeMenu: 'settings' }) %>

    <main class="main-area">
        <header class="top-header">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;">
                <button class="menu-toggle" onclick="document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open')">
                    <i class="fas fa-bars" style="font-size:1.2rem;"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="page-title">
                    <h2><i class="fas fa-cog" style="color:var(--primary);margin-right:8px;"></i>Setelan Akun</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="content-area">
            <% if (success) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-success">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <%= success %>
                </div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (error) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-error">
                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> <%= error %>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/settings/update" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                <div class="settings-card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i>
                        <h3>Profil Pribadi</h3>
                    </div>

                    <!-- AVATAR UPLOAD -->
                    <div class="avatar-upload">
                        <div class="avatar-preview" id="avatarPreviewBox">
                            <% if (user && user.profile_picture) { %>
                                <img src="<%= user.profile_picture %>" alt="Profile" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
                            <% } else { %>
                                <%= (user && user.nama) ? user.nama.charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'U' %>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="upload-btn-wrapper">
                                <button type="button" class="btn-upload"><i class="fas fa-camera"></i> Ubah Foto Profil</button>
                                <input type="file" name="profile_picture" id="avatarInput" accept="image/*" onchange="previewImage(this)">
                            </div>
                            <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px;">Format: JPG, PNG. Maksimal 5MB.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px;">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="form-label">Nama Lengkap</label>
                            <input type="text" name="nama" class="form-input" value="<%= user ? user.nama : '' %>" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="form-label">Alamat Email</label>
                            <input type="email" name="email" class="form-input" value="<%= user ? user.email : '' %>" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="settings-card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
                        <h3>Keamanan (Opsional)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label">Sandi Baru</label>
                        <input type="password" name="password" class="form-input" placeholder="Kosongkan jika tidak ingin mengubah sandi">
                        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px;">Isi hanya jika Anda ingin mengganti kata sandi akun CekUangku Anda.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 40px;">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-save"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Simpan Perubahan</button>
                </div>
            </form>

            <!-- SYARAT & KETENTUAN COLLAPSE -->
            <div class="collapse-container" id="tncCollapse">
                <div class="collapse-header" onclick="toggleCollapse()">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-file-contract" style="margin-right:8px; color:var(--primary);"></i> Syarat & Ketentuan Penggunaan</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="collapse-content">
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>1. Privasi & Keamanan Data</strong></p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Kami di CekUangku menghargai privasi Anda. Semua data transaksi, dompet, dan profil pengguna akan disimpan dengan aman menggunakan enkripsi berstandar industri. Data Anda tidak akan dibagikan ke pihak ketiga tanpa izin resmi dari Anda.</p>
                    
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>2. Penggunaan API & Laporan</strong></p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Sistem auto-laporan disediakan "as is". Pengguna disarankan tetap melakukan pengecekan ganda apabila laporan tersebut digunakan untuk kebutuhan hukum atau pajak resmi.</p>

                    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>3. Perubahan Layanan</strong></p>
                    <p>Developer berhak untuk mengubah, menangguhkan, atau menghentikan sebagian atau seluruh fitur CekUangku kapan saja dengan atau tanpa pemberitahuan sebelumnya, meskipun kami akan selalu mengupayakan stabilitas yang terbaik untuk pengguna setia kami.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FOOTER -->
        <footer class="custom-footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <strong>CekUangku</strong> by Project Kel 5. Dibuat dengan <i class="fas fa-heart" style="color: #ef4444;"></i> untuk manajemen keuangan Anda.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 6px;">Butuh bantuan? Kunjungi halaman <a href="/about">Tentang Kami</a>.</p>
        </footer>
    </main>

    <script>
        // Preview Imej Real-Time
        function previewImage(input) {
            if (input.files && input.files[0]) {
                var reader = new FileReader();
                reader.onload = function(e) {
                    var previewBox = document.getElementById('avatarPreviewBox');
                    previewBox.innerHTML = '<img src="' + e.target.result + '" alt="Profile" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">';
                }
                reader.readAsDataURL(input.files[0]);
            }
        }

        // Collapse functionality
        function toggleCollapse() {
            document.getElementById('tncCollapse').classList.toggle('active');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
